<div class="sec" id="s8">
  <div class="num">08</div>
  <h2>Optional: put your website online</h2>
  <p class="lede">
    Ready to share a link? Publish your checked HTML/CSS site using Cloudflare
    Pages' free browser upload. No Git, extra software or domain purchase is
    needed.
  </p>
  <p>
    This is a separate decision to make your photos and words public. Upload
    only a prepared public-files folder, never your whole working project or
    backup.
  </p>
  <p>
    <a href="/publish/index.html">Open the publishing guide</a> for file preparation,
    live checks, updates and undoing a deployment. It also explains the choice over
    Vercel and Netlify and covers
    <a href="/publish/index.html#technology"
      >Astro and choosing technology for larger sites</a
    >
    and <a href="/publish/index.html#migrate">moving an existing portfolio</a>.
    AWS S3 and CloudFront can wait for a later guide.
  </p>
</div>
